    <string name="home_how_step1">1. Agree on a passphrase in person, then exchange the invite code (CKS1:…) once.</string>
    <string name="home_how_step2">2. Sending: select the text you typed and tap \"Encrypt (CipherKey)\" in the selection toolbar — on Samsung it is inside the ⋮ overflow menu. The selection is replaced by the CK1:… message.</string>
    <string name="home_how_step3">3. Receiving: select the CK1:… message and tap \"Decrypt (CipherKey)\", or share it to CipherKey.</string>
    <string name="home_how_step4">4. If an app hides the toolbar entries, use the clipboard buttons, the in-app Encrypt/Decrypt tabs, or the floating assistant.</string>
