    <string name="home_security_b1">• Zero Android permissions, no network code.</string>
    <string name="home_security_b2">• AES-256-GCM with Argon2id key derivation (RFC 9106).</string>
    <string name="home_security_b3">• Keys live in memory only and are wiped on lock or timeout.</string>
    <string name="home_security_b4">• Optional fingerprint unlock uses hardware-backed Keystore keys.</string>
    <string name="home_security_b5">• No servers — nothing ever leaves this device.</string>
